### 5.2 回滚机制
```javascript
class RollbackManager {
    constructor() {
        this.checkpoints = [];
        this.healthChecks = [];
    }

    // 创建检查点
    createCheckpoint() {
        const checkpoint = {
            timestamp: Date.now(),
            legacyState: this.captureLegacyState(),
            nextState: this.captureNextState()
        };
        this.checkpoints.push(checkpoint);
    }

    // 健康检查失败时自动回滚
